From: Pieter Bakker <p.bakker@corp-europe.example>
Sent: Thursday, 08 October 2026 10:30
To: Lukas Becker
Subject: RE: DESADV to Brightwater failing since 7 Oct - IDoc status 51

Found it. On 6 Oct we transported a change to the DESADV mapping for the new =
pallet label layout. Since then the SSCC field is filled from the wrong sourc=
e field for mixed pallets, and the target segment expects exactly 18 digits. =
The mapping rejects the message, so the IDoc ends in status 51 before it leav=
es SAP. This is our mistake, I did not test a delivery with mixed pallets. I =
need to correct the mapping and test it against the Brightwater test endpoint=
. Realistic date for production is early next week, I will confirm.

Regards,
Pieter Bakker
